# Balance on turn 3: Bot1 (two lands, Mother of Runes and Ornithopter, three cards in hand) against Bot2 (one land,
# Llanowar Elves and two Ornithopters, four cards in hand). Each kind is evened out to the player with the fewest
# (Balance's text): Bot1 has more lands and chooses which to sacrifice, keeping the
# Tundra; Bot2 has the most cards in hand and creatures and chooses what goes, keeping the Elves; Bot1, who has the
# fewest creatures and cards in hand, is asked nothing about them.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mother of Runes
Ornithopter
Tundra
Balance
Island
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Island
Island
Island
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Mother of Runes.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast

[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast

[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Tundra.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Tundra.Activate(Ability: {W})
Bot1.Hand.Balance.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Plains)
Bot2.Choose(Island)
Bot2.Choose(Ornithopter)

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Bot1.Battlefield = Tundra; Mother of Runes; Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 3
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest; Llanowar Elves; Ornithopter
Bot2.Battlefield.Count = 3
